          "text": "One slot is ten nodes: button, two Merges (arm and disarm have one input each), Latch, Sample & Hold on the bar, Compare, two Gate to Triggers, the Clip, and a Readout standing in for a 'playing' light. Six slots are sixty. A scene is a Merge per slot feeding the arm."
