        "id": "60",
        "kind": "comment",
        "config": {
          "text": "The looper: press once, recording starts at the next bar; press again, it ends at the next bar and the Sampler starts looping the take 50 ms later, hoping the file is on disk by then. A second press to overdub would need another Record and Sampler pair and a swap: not built."
        },
